{'symbol': 'BLL', 'date': '2019-10-16 22:30:00', 'title': 'BALL CORP. ANNOUNCES TO BUILD PLANT IN ROME TO MAKE ALUMINUM CUPS', 'text': "BALL CORP. ANNOUNCED TO BUILD A PLANT IN ROME TO MAKE ALUMINUM CUPS. THE COMPANY SAID ITS NEW PLANT IS MEANT TO SERVE A GROWING MARKET FOR MORE ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY BEVERAGE PACKAGING. ROUGHLY 75% OF THE ALUMINUM EVER PRODUCED IS STILL IN USE ON OCTOBER 17, 2019. THE ROME PLANT WILL MAKE ALUMINUM CUPS IN A RANGE OF SIZES. THE NEW PLANT, WHICH WILL BE OPERATING BY THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2020, WILL SIT NEXT TO THE COMPANY'S EXISTING PLANT."}{'symbol': 'BLL', 'date': '2019-10-16 09:30:00', 'title': 'BALL CORPORATION TO BUILD NEW ALUMINUM CUPS MANUFACTURING PLANT IN GEORGIA', 'text': 'BALL CORPORATION TO BUILD NEW ALUMINUM CUPS MANUFACTURING PLANT IN GEORGIA.BALL CORP - NEW ALUMINUM CUPS MANUFACTURING FACILITY AND IS EXPECTED TO RAMP UP PRODUCTION IN Q4 OF 2020.BALL CORP - PLANS TO HIRE ABOUT 145 NEW EMPLOYEES FOR CUPS FACILITY TO SUPPORT MULTI-YEAR INVESTMENT OF ABOUT $200 MILLION.'}